<title>USA: Cyclone threatens southern Indian Ocean shipping.</title>
<headline>Cyclone threatens southern Indian Ocean shipping.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical cyclone Rhonda is an increasing risk to shipping in the southeast Indian Ocean as top winds reach 75 mph, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The system, near 13s/93.3e, will strengthen slightly over the next 24 hours before beginning a slow weakening trend.</p>
<p>It will remain over open waters.</p>
